    "finalName": "",
    "description": "Once per day, you can spend 10 minutes meditating to seek visions of the future. At that time, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> as a part of this meditation.<br><br>Once during the rest of the day, whenever you or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> you <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot_(Vehicle_Combat)\" title=\"Pilot (Vehicle Combat)\">Pilot</a> are the target of an attack, you can choose to negate that attack provided the attack roll is not a Natural 20. At the end of the day, if you did not use this ability, you regain the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> spent on the meditation.",
